It is evening time.
I am in my new flat.
I am very hungry.
I want dinner.
I go into the kitchen.
I open the cupboard.
But the cupboard is completely empty.
There is no rice in the cupboard.
There is no dal there either.
I open the fridge.
There are no vegetables in the fridge.
There is only one bottle of water.
I really like home-cooked food.
But today there is nothing in the house.
I want groceries for my new flat.
I want fresh vegetables.
I want fruits too.
So I make a grocery list now.
